  "alt": "The agent memory stack from the bottom up: an embedding and storage layer such as pgvector, Pinecone, or Qdrant holds memories outside the context window; a retrieval layer combines dense vectors with BM25; a ranking layer reorders candidates; and the result reaches the agent's context window, the active working state.",
